{"title":"야생화","artist":"박효신","sourceId":"reference:special_wild_flower_park_hyo_shin","sourceHash":"1e024577d9a68645e8fce6276e668d1bd25fb3afc7aa47c0617df65e089db52e","performanceStatus":"reference_timing","timingMethod":"reference_lrc_unverified","reviewStatus":"draft","cue_timing_confirmed":false,"timingWarning":"(주의) 노래와 함께 타이밍 검증되지 않았음","referenceProvider":"LRCLIB","referenceId":37074482,"cues":[{"id":"1","start":13.25,"end":26.04,"text":"하얗게 피어난 얼음 꽃 하나가","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"2","start":26.04,"end":36.89,"text":"달가운 바람에 얼굴을 내밀어","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"3","start":36.89,"end":47.64,"text":"아무 말 못했던 이름도 몰랐던","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"4","start":47.64,"end":58.1,"text":"지나간 날들에 눈물이 흘러","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"5","start":58.1,"end":64.06,"text":"차가운 바람에 숨어 있다","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"6","start":64.06,"end":69.65,"text":"한줄기 햇살에 몸 녹이다","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"7","start":69.65,"end":79.03,"text":"그렇게 너는 또 한번 내게 온다","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"8","start":79.03,"end":85.43,"text":"좋았던 기억만","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"9","start":85.43,"end":91.28999999999999,"text":"그리운 마음만","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"10","start":91.28999999999999,"end":96.12,"text":"니가 떠나간 그 길 위에","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"11","start":96.12,"end":101.65,"text":"이렇게 남아 서있다","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"12","start":101.65,"end":106.78,"text":"잊혀질 만큼만","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"13","start":106.78,"end":112.8,"text":"괜찮을 만큼만","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"14","start":112.8,"end":119.47999999999999,"text":"눈물 머금고 기다린 떨림 끝에","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"15","start":119.47999999999999,"end":128.7,"text":"다시 나를 피우리라","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"16","start":128.7,"end":139.03,"text":"사랑은 피고 또 지는 타버리는 불꽃","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"17","start":139.03,"end":149.17000000000002,"text":"빗물에 젖을까 두 눈을 감